# SHADOW VEIL — Chapter I: The Ashen Grove
# Room-based ASCII format. Legend:
#   # earth/stone   = wooden planks   - one-way beam   ^ stakes   % false wall   B breakable fence
#   h tall grass    P player start    S camp   s/y/r swordsman/spearman/archer   T boss
#   G grapple ring  $ mon   * shuriken   o resin bead   m material   L/l/f lantern/hanging lantern/fire
# Extra lines per room: spawn <kind> x y k=v..., prop <kind> x y k=v..., trigger x y w h <action> [repeat]
#   W timber house wall (solid)
# Coordinates are tiles, local to the room; y is the row the object stands in.

level ch1
title "The Ashen Grove"
kanji "灰竹林"
height 30

